            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='28270' id='18' type-v2='text' w='98730' x='635' y='70734'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>KEY FINDINGS &amp; RETENTION RECOMMENDATIONS</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>1. Month-to-Month Contracts Have Higher Churn</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Customers on month-to-month contracts show a higher churn rate than customers on one-year or two-year contracts.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> Offer loyalty benefits, renewal incentives, or discounts for customers who choose longer-term contracts.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>2. Early Customer Retention Is Important</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Churn patterns across tenure groups can help identify when customers are more likely to leave.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> Introduce onboarding support, early engagement messages, and follow-ups for new customers.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>3. Review the Customer Experience</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Differences in churn across service and payment categories can help identify groups that may need additional support.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Recommendation:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> Review customer feedback, billing issues, and service quality before deciding which interventions to prioritize.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
